{
	"$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
	"$comment": "Facade Code Framework's settings file, facade.json in the Facade home: by default ~/.facade/facade.json (docs/extension/features/CONFIGURATION.md).",
	"title": "Facade Code Framework settings",
	"type": "object",
	"allowComments": true,
	"allowTrailingCommas": true,
	"additionalProperties": false,
	"properties": {
		"$schema": {
			"type": "string",
			"description": "For the editor only. Facade Code Extension checks that it is a string and does not use its value."
		},
		"yolo": {
			"type": "boolean",
			"default": true,
			"markdownDescription": "With `true`, Facade Code Framework handles CLI approvals and directory trust prompts, disables the CLI sandbox where supported, and lets MCP callers reach all agents across connected machines. With `false`, each CLI keeps its own approvals and sandbox, and MCP callers reach only their entire creation tree. Facade Code Framework tools need no approval in either mode. Changes apply to managed agents on start or Resume and to Guests when they connect."
		},
		"names": {
			"type": "array",
			"items": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S" },
			"markdownDescription": "Names for agents and Guests without a name. Facade Code Framework picks a name at random, preferring names unused in `facade list` and allowing duplicates when all names are in use."
		},
		"clis": {
			"type": "object",
			"default": {},
			"markdownDescription": "The CLIs New Agent offers, by name. A built-in's name (`claude`, `codex`, `agy`, `muse`, `opencode`, `pi`, `devin`, `agent`, `kiro-cli`, `qoder`, `omp`, `copilot`) changes that built-in; any other name adds a CLI, which needs a `type`. Each entry stands alone.",
			"properties": {
				"claude": { "$ref": "#/definitions/claude", "markdownDescription": "Claude Code." },
				"codex": { "$ref": "#/definitions/codex", "markdownDescription": "Codex." },
				"agy": { "$ref": "#/definitions/agy", "markdownDescription": "Antigravity." },
				"muse": { "$ref": "#/definitions/muse", "markdownDescription": "Muse Code." },
				"opencode": { "$ref": "#/definitions/opencode", "markdownDescription": "OpenCode." },
				"pi": { "$ref": "#/definitions/pi", "markdownDescription": "Pi." },
				"devin": { "$ref": "#/definitions/devin", "markdownDescription": "Devin." },
				"agent": { "$ref": "#/definitions/agent", "markdownDescription": "Cursor." },
				"kiro-cli": { "$ref": "#/definitions/kiro-cli", "markdownDescription": "Kiro." },
				"qoder": { "$ref": "#/definitions/qoder", "markdownDescription": "Qoder." },
				"omp": { "$ref": "#/definitions/omp", "markdownDescription": "Oh My Pi." },
				"copilot": { "$ref": "#/definitions/copilot", "markdownDescription": "GitHub Copilot CLI." }
			},
			"propertyNames": {
				"pattern": "^(?:(?:claude|codex|agy|muse|opencode|pi|devin|agent|kiro-cli|qoder|omp|copilot)|(?!(?:[cC][lL][aA][uU][dD][eE]|[cC][lL][aA][uU][dD][eE] [cC][oO][dD][eE]|[cC][oO][dD][eE][xX]|[aA][gG][yY]|[aA][nN][tT][iI][gG][rR][aA][vV][iI][tT][yY]|[mM][uU][sS][eE]|[mM][uU][sS][eE] [cC][oO][dD][eE]|[oO][pP][eE][nN][cC][oO][dD][eE]|[pP][iI]|[dD][eE][vV][iI][nN]|[aA][gG][eE][nN][tT]|[cC][uU][rR][sS][oO][rR]|[kK][iI][rR][oO]-[cC][lL][iI]|[kK][iI][rR][oO]|[qQ][oO][dD][eE][rR]|[oO][mM][pP]|[oO][hH] [mM][yY] [pP][iI]|[cC][oO][pP][iI][lL][oO][tT]|[gG][iI][tT][hH][uU][bB] [cC][oO][pP][iI][lL][oO][tT] [cC][lL][iI])$)(?=[\\s\\S]*[^\\s\\p{Cf}])(?!\\s)(?![\\s\\S]*\\s$)[^\\p{Cc}]*)$",
				"patternErrorMessage": "A CLI's name needs a visible character, no space at either end and no control character, and it cannot be a built-in CLI's ID or name in any letter case."
			},
			"additionalProperties": { "$ref": "#/definitions/added" },
			"defaultSnippets": [
				{
					"label": "Claude Code on another API",
					"body": {
						"${1:Claude Code · my-model}": {
							"type": "claude",
							"model": "${2:my-model}",
							"env": {
								"ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL": "${3:https://api.example.com/anthropic}",
								"ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN": "${4:\\${env:MY_API_KEY\\}}",
								"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY": null,
								"ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL": "${2:my-model}",
								"ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL": "${2:my-model}",
								"ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL": "${5:my-small-model}"
							}
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"label": "Codex with a profile",
					"body": { "${1:Codex · work}": { "type": "codex", "args": ["--profile", "${2:work}"] } }
				},
				{
					"label": "Another program",
					"body": { "${1:my-cli}": { "type": "custom", "program": "${2:my-cli}", "args": [] } }
				}
			]
		}
	},
	"definitions": {
		"program": {
			"type": "string",
			"pattern": "\\S",
			"markdownDescription": "One program, not a shell command line: a name without a slash is found on PATH; otherwise an absolute path, `~/...`, or a path from the agent's folder. Left out, the type's own command on PATH."
		},
		"legacyCommand": {
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/program" }],
			"deprecationMessage": "Use program for this executable.",
			"doNotSuggest": true
		},
		"programFields": {
			"not": { "required": ["program", "command"] },
			"errorMessage": "program conflicts with command. Keep program."
		},
		"args": {
			"type": "array",
			"items": { "type": "string" },
			"default": [],
			"markdownDescription": "Arguments, passed exactly as written and in order: no shell, nothing expanded. Options Facade Code Framework sets or decides itself - approvals and sandbox (`yolo`), model and effort (their fields), the folder, the session and the first task - are refused."
		},
		"env": {
			"type": "object",
			"default": {},
			"additionalProperties": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
			"markdownDescription": "A string sets an environment variable and `null` removes it. `${env:NAME}` reads NAME from the initiator's environment for a local launch, or from the destination machine's login environment for a remote launch. The referenced variable must exist."
		},
		"model": {
			"type": "string",
			"pattern": "\\S",
			"markdownDescription": "The model new agents use where a start names none. Left out, the CLI's own configuration decides."
		},
		"enabled": {
			"type": "boolean",
			"default": true,
			"markdownDescription": "`false`: not offered in New Agent, and starts and restorations of it are refused. Running agents keep running."
		},
		"icon": {
			"enum": ["claude", "codex", "agy", "muse", "opencode", "pi", "devin", "agent", "kiro-cli", "qoder", "omp", "copilot", "facade-red", "facade-orange", "facade-amber", "facade-lime", "facade-green", "facade-teal", "facade-sky", "facade-blue", "facade-violet", "facade-pink", "facade-aurora", "facade-sunset", "facade-ocean", "facade-orchid", "facade-pearl", "facade-graphite"],
			"markdownEnumDescriptions": [
				"Claude Code's own icon.",
				"Codex's own icon.",
				"Antigravity's own icon.",
				"Muse Code's own icon.",
				"OpenCode's own icon.",
				"Pi's own icon.",
				"Devin's own icon.",
				"Cursor's own icon.",
				"Kiro's own icon.",
				"Qoder's own icon.",
				"Oh My Pi's own icon.",
				"GitHub Copilot CLI's own icon.",
				"Robot: light red to red.",
				"Robot: light orange to deep orange.",
				"Robot: pale yellow to amber.",
				"Robot: light lime to deep lime green.",
				"Robot: light green to green.",
				"Robot: light teal to deep teal.",
				"Robot: light sky blue to deep sky blue.",
				"Robot: light blue to blue.",
				"Robot: lavender to violet.",
				"Robot: light pink to deep pink.",
				"Robot: violet to cyan.",
				"Robot: coral red to warm yellow.",
				"Robot: emerald green to sky blue.",
				"Robot: pink to violet.",
				"Robot: white to silver gray.",
				"Robot: gray to near black."
			],
			"markdownDescription": "The entry's icon in the panel, New Agent and terminal tab. Defaults to its type's own icon, or facade-pearl for custom."
		},
		"claude": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "claude", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Claude Code's. Its type can only be \"claude\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"effort": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "examples": ["low", "medium", "high", "xhigh", "max", "ultracode"], "markdownDescription": "The reasoning effort new agents use where a start names none: Claude Code's `--effort`. `ultracode` asks for `xhigh` with ultracode on." },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"codex": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "codex", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Codex's. Its type can only be \"codex\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"effort": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "examples": ["low", "medium", "high", "xhigh", "max", "ultra"], "markdownDescription": "The reasoning effort new agents use where a start names none: Codex's `model_reasoning_effort`. Which levels work depends on the model." },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"agy": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "agy", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Antigravity's. Its type can only be \"agy\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"effort": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "examples": ["low", "medium", "high", "xhigh", "max"], "markdownDescription": "The reasoning effort new agents use where a start names none: Antigravity's `--effort`." },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"muse": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "muse", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Muse Code's. Its type can only be \"muse\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"effort": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "examples": ["none", "minimal", "low", "medium", "high", "xhigh", "max", "ultra"], "markdownDescription": "The reasoning effort new agents use where a start names none: Muse Code's `reasoning_effort` for the run." },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"opencode": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "opencode", "markdownDescription": "This entry is OpenCode's. Its type can only be \"opencode\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"pi": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "pi", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Pi's. Its type can only be \"pi\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "markdownDescription": "The model new agents use where a start names none; `provider/model` names its provider too." },
				"effort": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "examples": ["off", "minimal", "low", "medium", "high", "xhigh", "max"], "markdownDescription": "The thinking level new agents use where a start names none: Pi's `--thinking`." },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"devin": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "devin", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Devin's. Its type can only be \"devin\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"agent": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "agent", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Cursor's. Its type can only be \"agent\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"kiro-cli": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "kiro-cli", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Kiro's. Its type can only be \"kiro-cli\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"effort": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "examples": ["low", "medium", "high"], "markdownDescription": "The reasoning effort new agents use where a start names none: Kiro's `--effort`." },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"qoder": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "qoder", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Qoder's. Its type can only be \"qoder\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"effort": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "examples": ["low", "medium", "high"], "markdownDescription": "The reasoning effort new agents use where a start names none: Qoder's `--reasoning-effort`." },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"omp": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "omp", "markdownDescription": "This entry is Oh My Pi's. Its type can only be \"omp\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"effort": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "examples": ["off", "minimal", "low", "medium", "high", "xhigh"], "markdownDescription": "The reasoning effort new agents use where a start names none: Oh My Pi's `--thinking`." },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"copilot": {
			"type": "object",
			"allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" }],
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"properties": {
				"type": { "const": "copilot", "markdownDescription": "This entry is GitHub Copilot CLI's. Its type can only be \"copilot\"; omitting it changes nothing." },
				"program": { "$ref": "#/definitions/program" },
				"command": { "$ref": "#/definitions/legacyCommand" },
				"args": { "$ref": "#/definitions/args" },
				"env": { "$ref": "#/definitions/env" },
				"model": { "$ref": "#/definitions/model" },
				"effort": { "type": "string", "pattern": "\\S", "examples": ["none", "minimal", "low", "medium", "high", "xhigh", "max"], "markdownDescription": "The reasoning effort new agents use where a start names none: GitHub Copilot CLI's `--reasoning-effort`." },
				"enabled": { "$ref": "#/definitions/enabled" },
				"icon": { "$ref": "#/definitions/icon" }
			}
		},
		"added": {
			"type": "object",
			"required": ["type"],
			"properties": {
				"type": {
					"enum": ["claude", "codex", "agy", "muse", "opencode", "pi", "devin", "agent", "kiro-cli", "qoder", "omp", "copilot", "custom"],
					"markdownEnumDescriptions": [
						"Claude Code, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Codex, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Antigravity, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Muse Code, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"OpenCode, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Pi, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Devin, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Cursor, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Kiro, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Qoder, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Oh My Pi, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"GitHub Copilot CLI, with everything Facade Code Framework gives it, under this name.",
						"Any other program, started in a terminal with nothing of Facade Code Framework's: no tools, messages, status, model, effort, Resume or Pin."
					],
					"markdownDescription": "The CLI this entry runs."
				}
			},
			"allOf": [
				{ "$ref": "#/definitions/programFields" },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "claude" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedClaude" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "codex" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedCodex" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "agy" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedAgy" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "muse" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedMuse" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "opencode" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedOpencode" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "pi" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedPi" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "devin" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedDevin" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "agent" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedAgent" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "kiro-cli" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedKiroCli" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "qoder" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedQoder" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "omp" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedOmp" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "copilot" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedCopilot" } },
				{ "if": { "properties": { "type": { "const": "custom" } } }, "then": { "$ref": "#/definitions/addedCustom" } }
			]
		},
